@startuml
<style>
timingDiagram {
  timeline {
    FontColor green
    LineColor red
    LineThickness 1
    LineStyle 5-2
  }
}
</style>

clock   "Clock_0"   as C0 with period 50
binary  "Binary"  as B
concise "Concise" as C
robust  "Robust"  as R
@0
C is Idle
R is Idle
@100
B is high
C is Waiting
R is Processing
@300
R is Waiting
@enduml